{"articleNo":"89242","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=89242&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 2학기 생활관 입사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.08.26","hit":"4541","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"450\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #ff0000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대리입사 적발 시 영구입사 불가 및 생활관비 환불 불가</span></strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span>&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013학년도 2학기 생활관 입사를 다음과 같이 안내합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ 관생실 배정공고</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 일시 : 2013. 8</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">. 28(수) 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 장소 : 생활관 홈페이지 공지사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 준비물 및 방법</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 신분증 : 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 여권 중 택 1 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(학생증 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 개인 비품 : 침구류, 세면도구 등 개인 생활 용품</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 입실 방법 : 입사 등록 후 입실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 등록</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 절차 : 본인확인 → 열쇠 수령 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 일정 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">2013. 8. 31(토) ~ 9. 1(일) 14:00~18:00</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 장소 : 푸름관-3동 현관, 오름관-식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 입사 기간 및 시간 외 입사 : 푸름관-3동 경비실, 오름관-방재실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 식수 혈관 등록</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -68.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 시간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사일 14:00～18:00, 각 관 식사시간(입사 기간 외에는 식사시간에 등록)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 장소 : 각 관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 방법 : 신분증 제시 후 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 식사 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8.31(토) 저녁부터 제공[</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">주5일 식사 신청자도 8.31(토)~9.1(일) 식사가능]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 추석[2013.9.19(목)]은 식사 미 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사 택배 안내</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 입사 전 생활관으로 보내는 짐 택배(옷, 생필품 등)는 보관할 장소(경비실 협소)가 없고 분실할 우려가 있으므로 입실 날 직접 짐을 가지고 오거나 입실 날에 맞추어 택배가 도착할 수 있도록 조정하여 본인이 직접 택배를 수령하시기 바랍니다. (예-목요일에 택배 발송시 토요일 중 택배가 도착하므로 토요일에 입사를 완료하여 직접 택배 수령)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 기타 안내</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 개사기간 - 2013.8.31(토) 14:00～12.23(월) 14:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 7pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 결핵검사 - 입사 후 9월 중 단체 X선 촬영</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;※ 입사 관련 문의</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 054) 478-7940</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013. 8</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교 생활관장</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
